# Mobile UI/UX

Read `docs/FLOWS_AND_SCREENS.md` before reskinning or adding screens.

## Primary action

- One obvious next step per screen. Use server `next_action` on match hub; use `deriveHomeNextActions` on Home.
- One primary CTA per view. Global create uses tab-bar `+`.

## Colour = information

- Use `tennisSemantic` tones from `tennis-tokens.ts`. Pair colour with glyph via `SemanticBadge`.
- No attendance/reliability badges on public player profiles.

## Async states

Every list or hub: loading, empty with liquidity CTA, error + retry. Never show empty when a query failed.

## Out of scope

Payments, leaderboards, social feed, public shame scores.
